    "en": {
      "trackName": "Fidget Toys - Watch Games",
      "description": "Turn your Apple Watch into a collection of satisfying interactive toys.\n\nTap, spin, click, pop, and unwind with a growing collection of tiny experiences inspired by real-world objects. Whether you have one minute or ten, there's always something fun on your wrist.\n\nFREE TO EXPLORE\nDownload and start playing right away. A selection of toys is available to try—feel the haptics, sound, and wrist-friendly controls before you decide to unlock more.\n\nONE-TIME UNLOCK\nWant everything? Upgrade once for the full collection. No subscription—restore anytime on a new watch.\n\nWHAT'S INSIDE\nTilt-and-roll challenges, satisfying pops and clicks, calm little rituals, arcade-style moments, and colorful 3D toys—short sessions made for Apple Watch.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n• Built for Apple Watch — small screen, one-hand play\n• Quick stress relief — commutes, breaks, or bedtime wind-down\n• Rich feedback — haptics, sound, and smooth animations\n• Play offline — your unlock stays on your device\n• Restore purchases anytime on a new watch\n\nWhether you need focus, calm, or just something fun to fidget with, there's a toy for every mood.\n\nDownload Fidget Toys and keep satisfaction on your wrist.",
